        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I've just tried the `gen_hook.adding_icon()` approach. Although it is relatively ok, my first reaction is that I don't really like misalignment that adding icons introduces. Plus highlighted icons don't dim with `MiniStarterInactive` when item is inactive (as it should because it is not part of an item), which is confusing.\r\n\r\nSo I think the first approach with modifying how prefix is computed and highlighted might be the best approach here.",
